{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 52,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.617027282714844,
        287.1528625488281,
        72.75702667236328
      ],
      "text": "Evidence from observational studies and indirect evidence",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        73.62702941894531,
        399.0428466796875,
        87.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "Hazir et al (2004) showed that 62% of 1004 children presenting with non-severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        86.62702941894531,
        399.0528259277344,
        100.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia and wheeze responded to bronchodilators. Among responders, only 15%",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        99.62702941894531,
        399.1029357910156,
        113.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "showed clinical deterioration at follow-up. Predictors of deterioration were: fever",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        112.62702941894531,
        399.1327209472656,
        126.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "> 38 °C (OR 6.61, 95% CI 2.73 to 16.11); history of fever (OR 2.11, 95% CI 1.44 to 3.03);",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        125.62702941894531,
        260.6429443359375,
        139.11703491210938
      ],
      "text": "or age 1-11 months (OR 1.83, 95% CI 1.26 to 2.66).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        138.6270294189453,
        399.0814208984375,
        152.11703491210938
      ],
      "text": "A prospective observational study of children presenting with fast breathing or",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.6270294189453,
        399.08282470703125,
        165.11703491210938
      ],
      "text": "lower chest indrawing and wheeze [Lochindarat, 2008] followed-up with children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.6269989013672,
        399.0530090332031,
        178.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "fulfilling the WHO criteria for non-severe pneumonia and wheeze responsive to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        177.6269989013672,
        399.0729064941406,
        191.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "bronchodilator. Of 263 children with non-severe pneumonia and wheeze, 85%",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.6269989013672,
        399.0428161621094,
        204.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "responded to bronchodilators and were discharged on oral salbutamol but no",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.6269989013672,
        399.0126647949219,
        217.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics. On follow-up, symptoms had resolved in 96% of children by day 3, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        216.6269989013672,
        399.123046875,
        230.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "in 97% by days 5–7. The only independent predictor of clinical deterioration was age",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.6269989013672,
        399.0528259277344,
        243.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "1–11 months. On a separate analysis, the following factors predicted non-response",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        242.6269989013672,
        399.04296875,
        256.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "to bronchodilators in children presenting with WHO-defined non-severe or severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        255.6269989013672,
        399.082763671875,
        269.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia and wheeze: age 12–59 months; history of fever; no family history of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        268.6269836425781,
        313.8428649902344,
        282.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "wheeze; fever > 38.0 °C; and presence of lower chest indrawing.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        281.6269836425781,
        399.0813903808594,
        295.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "Kabir et al (2009) conducted a non-blinded, randomized multi-centre trial of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        294.6269836425781,
        399.0926513671875,
        308.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics for bronchiolitis in Bangladesh. Children aged <24 months with runny",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        307.6269836425781,
        399.0328063964844,
        321.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "nose, cough, breathing difficulty, chest indrawing, and rhonchi on auscultation were",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        320.6269836425781,
        399.01287841796875,
        334.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "enrolled and allocated to one of three groups: ampicillin (7 days); oral erythromycin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        333.6269836425781,
        399.1028137207031,
        347.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "(7 days); or no antibiotics. All children received nebulized salbutamol, oxygen (if",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        346.6269836425781,
        399.0596923828125,
        360.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "SpO  < 90%), IV fluids, nasogastric feeding, and oropharyngeal suction. The study",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        74.15969848632812,
        353.91302490234375,
        77.0396957397461,
        362.00701904296875
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        359.6269836425781,
        399.1529235839844,
        373.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "recruited 327 children; 10% dropped out. Baseline characteristics were similar across",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        372.6269836425781,
        399.1028137207031,
        386.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "groups. There were no significant differences in clinical improvement between groups.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        385.6269836425781,
        399.06280517578125,
        399.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "Children in the no-antibiotic group had a significantly shorter duration of hospital",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        398.6269836425781,
        399.0828857421875,
        412.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "stay than the antibiotic groups (p<0.001). For all children, most breathing or chest",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        411.6269836425781,
        399.0928039550781,
        425.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "symptoms (i.e. cough, breathing difficulty, wheeze, chest indrawing, tachypnoea,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        424.6269836425781,
        343.9629211425781,
        438.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "tachycardia, rhonchi, and crepitations) gradually improved after day 4.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        437.6269836425781,
        399.0514221191406,
        451.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "Cardoso et al (2010) studied the ability of WHO criteria to identify pneumonia",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        450.6269836425781,
        399.082763671875,
        464.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "among children presenting with wheeze. Children 2–59 months presenting to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        463.6269836425781,
        399.1328125,
        477.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "the paediatric emergency department of five hospitals in Brazil with acute lower",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        476.6269836425781,
        399.1029357910156,
        490.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "respiratory tract infections (LRTI) were prospectively recruited. Diagnoses were",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        489.6269836425781,
        399.1028747558594,
        503.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "further subclassified as pneumonia, acute bronchitis, acute bronchiolitis, wheezing,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        502.626953125,
        399.0728759765625,
        516.116943359375
      ],
      "text": "and recurrent wheezing. All diagnoses where made by three physicians, blinded to each",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        515.626953125,
        399.05279541015625,
        529.116943359375
      ],
      "text": "others’ diagnoses: the admitting paediatrician; a chest physician; and a radiologist.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        528.626953125,
        399.0528564453125,
        542.116943359375
      ],
      "text": "Chest X-rays were taken for all cases of suspected pneumonia and bronchiolitis.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        541.626953125,
        399.1528015136719,
        555.116943359375
      ],
      "text": "Where a chest X-ray was done, the final diagnosis required the agreement of at least",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        554.6270141601562,
        169.92286682128906,
        568.1170043945312
      ],
      "text": "two of the three physicians.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        567.6270141601562,
        399.1113586425781,
        581.1170043945312
      ],
      "text": "Data for 390 children were analyzed. Chest X-rays were performed for 153 of these",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        580.6270141601562,
        399.0328369140625,
        594.1170043945312
      ],
      "text": "children. Diagnoses were acute bronchitis in 28 (7%) children, acute bronchiolitis",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        593.6270141601562,
        399.0428466796875,
        607.1170043945312
      ],
      "text": "in 7 (2%), wheezing in 117 (30%), recurrent wheezing in 168 (43%) and pneumonia",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.3863067626953,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6573028564453,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "38",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}